# Extra folder roots for `clo`, scanned after $DEV_ROOT. Copy to
#     ${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}/agents-shared/clo-extra-roots
# and keep it there, untracked.
#
# One folder per line (~ allowed). Blank lines and # comments are skipped. Each root is a
# row in clo's folder menu, and every folder local-repos-list reports under it is a row
# named <root name>/<folder> (work/some-repo), which `clo NAME` also matches.
~/dev/work
